---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import GodHero from '../../../components/GodHero.astro';
import GodMarquee from '../../../components/GodMarquee.astro';
import GuaranteeMatrix from '../../../components/GuaranteeMatrix.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home Remodeling in Venezuela | RemodelaT" description="High-standard home remodeling for houses, apartments and townhouses in Valencia, San Diego, Carabobo and Caracas. Technical assessment, proper materials and written warranties." activePage="services">
  <GodHero
  eyebrow="High-standard homes"
  title="Home Remodeling"
  titleGold="in Venezuela"
  lead="Houses, apartments, quintas and townhouses remodeled with technical planning, proper materials, supervised execution and documented warranties."
  image="/images/integrales-proyecto-completo.webp"
  imageAlt="High-standard home remodeling in Venezuela"
  badges={["High Standard", "Technical Method", "Written Warranty"]}
  watermark="IN VENEZUELA"
/>

<GodMarquee />
  <section class="article-section"><div class="container"><div class="article-body">
    <p>Home remodeling can be partial or complete, but the standard should always be the same: clear scope, compatible materials, controlled utilities, clean finishes and a handover that explains what is covered.</p>
    <h2>What home remodeling includes</h2>
    <p>We coordinate kitchens, bathrooms, flooring, wall coverings, electrical work, plumbing, painting, exterior areas and final finishes under one method. The goal is not to “do everything,” but to control the technical trades required for a durable, high-end result.</p>
    <h2>Who this service is for</h2>
    <ul><li>Owners who want a long-lasting remodel, not a quick cosmetic fix.</li><li>Properties where finish quality and hidden utilities both matter.</li><li>Homes in residential areas that require order, protection and reliable scheduling.</li><li>Owners who value a written proposal and warranty by scope.</li></ul>
    <h2>The RemodelaT approach</h2>
    <p>Before starting, we review the property condition, define the scope, specify materials, plan logistics and document warranty conditions. This is what prevents improvisation during the work.</p>
    <p><strong>Next step:</strong> <a href="/en/contact">request a technical assessment</a> and tell us your location, property type and desired finish level.</p>
  </div></div></section>
  <GuaranteeMatrix lang="en" compact />
  <section class="cta-section"><div class="cta-wrapper"><h2 class="cta-title">Ready to remodel your home properly?</h2><p class="cta-text">Request a technical assessment and receive a detailed proposal according to scope, finish level and site conditions.</p><a href="/en/contact" class="btn-premium btn-primary-premium"><span class="btn-content">Request technical assessment</span><span class="btn-border"></span><span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
